 
Well, it's the winter solstice season again, and mudders everywhere
are looking for good gifts for one another. What can you buy? Well,
here's a gift-buying guide for you mudders out there who'd like to
impress that special someone with your savoir faire. As befits the
season, I went to a toy store, namely Cat's Toys.
 
Cat's Toys is hidden a bit off the beaten track from the rest of the
village: 2e, 2n, 2w, and n from the village green (or w, n, 2w, n from
the village pub). There's no hint from either the view from the street
or, really, from within the store that this is one of the best places
on the mud to buy gifts, but it is. Read the sign in the store and
you'll see this list of wonderful presents:
 
